  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Business Environment programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to improve the business environment in middle-income economies by stimulating growth and creating jobs, helping to lift people out of poverty. It is worth &#xa3;30 million over 4 years, and aims to support reforms that improve the business environment in a range of middle-income countries.</narrative>
  </description>
